H2: Frequently Asked Questions
H3: What is a forex white label?
 It's a complete brokerage technology foundation provided by a technology company and branded as your own. Your clients deal with your brokerage, while the technology is supplied and maintained behind the scenes.
H3: Is a white label the same as owning my own trading platform?
 Not exactly. The underlying platform technology belongs to its developer. The brokerage, brand, clients, configuration and trading conditions are yours.
H3: Do I still need a licence with a white label?
 In most cases, yes, but it depends on your jurisdiction and business model. A white label is technology, not regulatory approval. You'll need qualified legal and compliance advice.
